{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716870/extras/subtitle.png?t=1752152407\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Prince of Darkness Jr.</strong> is a block-pushing puzzle game where you can't step into the light!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Squatters are moving into Castle Darkness and turning on all the old gas lamps. It's up to the young Prince to get around the castle and stop them from taking over his home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move blocks to cast shadows and open doors in over 200 fiendishly tricky levels. Find secrets, experiment with new mechanics, watch out for danger, and get to the end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716870/extras/level_transparent.png?t=1752152407\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Originally created as part of the 1-Bit Game Jam 2023.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3716870?t=1752152407","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716870/89bfe25904e606265e70c85571af363f30b44da9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752152407","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716870/fc45a72788ddd6893598180c0b22f7da29755532/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752152407","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716870/fc45a72788ddd6893598180c0b22f7da29755532/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752152407","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","i